g down from the cups of the sleeps, and there are two independent Chrysanthemum flowers on the chests and elves The front of the skin hang down, and the red skin pants below are tied at the Ankle This is why they are loose bulking below She sees to be wearing \"tabi\" and black shoes Since she is not wearing a hat, her long black hair is tied up in a bundle at the back of her head with a white cloth\n[59] Is she a villager? A priest or something? Jibiki couldn't see the subtle expression on the girl's face, but he could feel the disapproval in her tone. [60] \"I was admiring the scenery. Can't I do that? There's no sign saying not to climb.\" [61] Yoshimaru couldn't help but blurt out an explanation. In his defense, he didn't realize he was admitting his mistake immediately. [62] \"So, even though it's not written, you know you can't climb, right?\" [63] The girl spoke in a clear, transparent voice, and Yoshimaru had no response. She then took out a fan from her chest and laughed. [64] \"Anyway, come down first.\n <Assistant> I have read the book and I will answer the question you ask.\n\nPassage 8:\nDialogue between User and Assistant 2026-06-12 03:46:48 \\n<User> The following context is the book I have read: \nYumi would refuse. It seems that one must trust her words and follow her instructions. [3694] At Yumi's request, the police brought Gen and Jushi. The scene from yesterday was repeated. In the parlor, Saito sat facing forward, and the young detectives stood guard at the door. [3695] Yesterday's hard work must have exhausted Gen, who was already short in stature. He shuffled into the room, his face looking dejected and glancing nervously around. Jushi, who had been a policeman, seemed to immediately sense the subtle atmosphere in the room. [3696] \"Why did you call us here?\" [3697] After sitting down next to Heshou, Sunyi looked at Yuying with bloodshot eyes. [3698] \"I know who the murderer is. That's why I want to tell everyone.\" [3699] \"Really?!\" [370